  "description": "Vikash built Bulkmockup, a Photoshop plugin that makes $12K/month. This video breaks down the three-step content system he uses to grow and get customers on auto-pilot\n\nBuild your own micro-saas → https://build.starterstory.com/select-plan?promo=TINY&utm_source=youtube&utm_campaign=vikash\n\nFollow Vikash: https://x.com/vikashkprajapat\nCheck out BulkMockup: https://www.bulkmockup.com/\n\n🔔 Follow the Second Channel: @StarterStoryBuild\n🏁 We're hiring: starterstory.com/jobs\n\nThis video is an educational case study of this founder’s experience. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee any income or results. Every business is different and your results may vary.\n\nChapters:\n0:00 - Intro\n1:13 - BulkMockup overview\n1:32 - Business analytics and dashboards\n2:13 - Founder background and idea\n3:34 - Going from idea to product\n4:34 - Content  through customer pain\n5:25 - Real examples of content\n6:40 - Content Flywheel Playbook pt. 1\n8:40 - Solve one problem\n9:38 - Content Flywheel Playbook pt. 2\n11:30 - App Demo\n12:48 - Tech Stack\n13:33 - Final advice\n14:18 - Pat and Gus reflections\n16:50 - Build your own app!",
